  "contradictory_card_ids": ["C30"],
  "decision_summary": "Two high-transferability positive records (topiramate >80%, pipemidic acid 93%) support F >= 20%; one high-transferability negative record (gemcitabine 10%) is outweighed by the positive direction of the transferred evidence.",
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "The contradictory gemcitabine record is directly below the threshold and has high assay-transfer score, adding uncertainty.",
    "Some positive records are qualitative or from patient populations rather than healthy-volunteer absolute measurements."
